    "text": "Every home, this month\nOpen Dues from the sidebar.\nSelect the Generate button at the top. It names the month, for example \"Generate Oct 2026 dues\".\nEnter the Amount per property.\nSelect Generate dues.\nA one-off or repeating charge\nOn the Dues page, select Add a due.\nUnder Who to bill, choose every property or one property.\nUnder How often, choose Once, Monthly (12 charges) or Annually.\nEnter the Amount per charge, the Due date and the Kind (Regular dues or Special assessment).\nSelect Add due to create the charges.",
