    "text": "\"Couldn’t record the payment\": nothing was saved. Try again; if it keeps failing, contact support.\nThe books aren’t open yet: your association has no fiscal period or chart of accounts, so the payment can't be posted. An admin selects Open the books, then records the payment again. A board member is pointed to the admins.",
