    "sectionId": "before-you-start",
    "heading": "Before you start",
    "text": "Board admins and board members can prepare the notice. Residents can't open the page.\nThe budget must be approved. A draft budget doesn't offer the notice.\nBill the year's dues first if you can. The per-home amount then comes from what each home is actually billed.",
    "roles": [
      "admin",
      "board"
    ],
