    "text": "Open Communications and select New message.\nUnder Audience, pick who gets it: Everyone, Owners only, Tenants only, Late on dues, Units with open violations, Specific property, Board or Custom contacts (people who aren't residents, like a vendor or your attorney). Each one shows how many people it reaches right now.\nFor Specific property (one address), choose the home, then tick the people living there. Owners, Tenants, All and None tick them for you.\nFor Board, tick the board members. For Custom contacts, type a name, email or US phone and select Add.\nSelect Continue, write the message, then select Continue again.\nUnder Channels, tick SMS to also send a text.\nCheck the Review box, then select Send now or Schedule.",
