    "text": "Open Properties and open the home.\nSelect the ⋯ menu next to Edit, then Prepare estoppel certificate.\nUnder The request, enter the day the request was received. In Florida, choose how it will be delivered and tick Requested on an expedited basis if it was.\nUnder Fill in the blanks, fill in each item the app doesn't hold: the requestor, parcel designation, transfer or capital contribution fee, the fee you charge and who signs. Florida adds the parking space, transfer approval, right of first refusal, other associations and insurance contacts.\nRead the certificate to the bottom. Anything still missing shows as a highlighted BLANK.\nTick I’ve verified these figures.\nSelect Print / Save as PDF. Choose your printer, or Save as PDF to send the file yourself.",
