    "text": "Monthly board report is your own choice. It applies to every association you're on the board of and does not change anyone else's emails. It is on unless you turn it off.\nTell residents about decisions and replies is one setting for the whole association, shared by every board member. It is off until a board turns it on.\nResident assistant is one setting for each association. It is off until a board turns it on.\nTurning it on doesn't send anything for decisions and replies made before. Only new ones are sent.\nIf an email or text can't be sent, the board's decision or reply is still saved.\nInternal notes are never sent to residents. Residents who turned off email or texts in their preferences aren't contacted that way.\nAlerts that need action, like a disconnected mailbox, always come through.\nThe General tab shows your profile and your association. Admins can change their name there and select Save name. Your sign-in email can't be changed there.",
    "roles": [
      "admin",
      "board"
    ],
    "routes": [
      "/settings/notifications",
      "/settings"
    ]
