    "text": "Tap Account, then Meetings and notices. On Home, you can also tap the Next meeting card.\nUnder Upcoming meetings, each meeting shows its type (board, special, annual or emergency), its date, and the agenda if the board posted one.\nUnder Past meetings, tap Read to open the approved minutes of a meeting.",
