    "text": "Most meetings are posted here at least 14 days ahead. An emergency meeting can be posted later.\nThe date is in your association's time zone. A meeting held today stays under Upcoming meetings until the day ends.\nMinutes appear only after the board approves them, usually at the next meeting. Draft minutes are never posted.\nThe time and place are in the board's notice. If they aren't listed, ask the board.",
